  "releaseNotes": "- Added StartedAt and FinishedAt timestamps to job lifecycle tracking.\n            - Replaced SetStatusAsync with explicit lifecycle transitions.\n            - Simplified Store API by aligning CompleteAsync and FailAsync result handling.\n            - Improved job monitoring UI and job detail views.\n            - Added Result display in Job details.\n            - Added UTC execution timeline visualization for jobs.\n            - Improved Definition management UI and editing experience.\n            - Refactored lifecycle and monitoring tests.\n            - Improved Blazor UI test coverage.\n            - General API cleanup, simplification, and reliability improvements.",
